      "note": "Formal atom balancing requires coefficient2:2NaF + Br2 →2NaBr + F2. This is not a plausible spontaneous halogen displacement under ordinary conditions:Br2 cannot displace fluoride to produce F2. Separate formal balancing from chemical feasibility."
